+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# B1's reader follow-up toward I4′, PY's lane (I100; RR "I4 made at `30f3d1b24a`; RV113's items for ROOT
+# ruled; …", rulings 1, 2 and 5). The inputs are RV113's probes (`probes_ts1.json`: the `h:`, `n6_` and
